ind":"update","title":"Hotfix 0.9.9.2","summary":"Fixed bullet time not triggering at all after unlock it in the skill treeFixed chain lightning triggering to often after unlockFixed that steam can't find .exeIf you don't see the update -> restart steam!See ya!Schlexii","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T12:43:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668623","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4694390-1841579228664891","game_id":"steam-4694390","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO out now!","summary":"Hey guys — it’s time! The demo is finally out now! 🎉The content of the demo isn’t fully representative of what the final release will look like in a couple of months, and the leaderboard hasn’t been implemented yet.I hope you guys have a blast playing my game! If you enjoy it, I’d really appreciate it if you could add it to your wishlist. ❤️See ya!Schlexii","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T09:09:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228664891","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4694390-1832065502807781","game_id":"steam-4694390","kind":"announcement","title":"Remember Moorhuhn? Now imagine it with chaos… and a leaderboard","summary":"Hey everyone 🐦💥I’m a solo developer and I just launched the Steam page for Crazy Bird Hunt!It’s a fast-paced arcade incremental game inspired by the classic Moorhuhn games from the early 2000s — but this time, it’s all about going bigger, faster… and beating everyone else.You’ll unlock crazy upgrades like chain lightning, bullet time, bombs and more — pushing your score higher and higher.And yes… there’s a global leaderboard.So the real question